1
00:00:00,039 --> 00:00:01,369
(Amy:)I said no.

2
00:00:01,375 --> 00:00:02,975
(Sheldon:)Interesting.

3
00:00:02,976 --> 00:00:07,146
(Sheldon:)I asked two women out today,
and they both said no.

4
00:00:07,147 --> 00:00:10,547
(Amy:)I didn't know you
were interested in dating.

5
00:00:10,550 --> 00:00:13,820
(Sheldon:)I've been told
it's a good way to move on.

6
00:00:13,820 --> 00:00:16,150
(Howard:)Oh.

7
00:00:16,156 --> 00:00:18,026
(Penny:)Okay.

8
00:00:20,493 --> 00:00:24,193
(Amy:)Anyway, um,
it's nice to see you.

9
00:00:24,197 --> 00:00:25,797
(Amy:)You look good.

10
00:00:25,799 --> 00:00:26,799
Mmm, thanks.

11
00:00:26,800 --> 00:00:28,200
(Sheldon:)And I taste good too.

12
00:00:36,870 --> 00:00:39,110
(Bernadette:)Howie?

13
00:00:39,355 --> 00:00:40,925
(Howard:)What's up?

14
00:00:41,759 --> 00:00:45,159
(Bernadette:)Why does your Fitbit say
you ran 174 miles yesterday?

